"This directive determines whether or not checks for this host will be "
"\"obsessed\" over. When enabled the obsess over host command will be "
"executed after every check of this host."
msgstr ""
"This directive determines whether or not checks for this host will be "
"\"obsessed\" over. When enabled the obsess over host command will be "
